# AI Review Dossier: <%== $pkg->{name} %> (Cavil package <%= $pkg->{id} %>)

Generated by Cavil <%= Cavil->VERSION %> for offline AI-assisted legal review. Cavil is a legal review and SBOM system
used to decide whether a package may be distributed. Everything an AI reviewer needs is in this file; nothing else
can be looked up.
